{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35895","headline":"薄命妾 · 胡曾","name":"薄命妾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阿娇初失汉皇恩，旧赐罗衣亦罢薰。\n倚枕夜悲金屋雨，卷帘朝泣玉楼云。\n宫前叶落鸳鸯瓦，架上尘生翡翠裙。\n龙骑不巡时渐久，长门空掩绿苔纹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}